  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Adding 1.5 at.% Si to an Mg-transition-metal powder blend and sintering at 850 °C will form a transient liquid phase through an Mg-Si eutectic reaction.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Si-induced transient liquid phase will enable rapid densification at 850 °C.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sintering with 1.5 at.% Si at 850 °C will suppress brittle intermetallic networks and elemental segregation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed process will produce a dense, pseudo-single-phase microstructure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed Si-containing microstructure will have enhanced oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e",
        "PMC6513993::chunk::000::abstract::e30693f104"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting powder has a mean particle size of 10–20 µm.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventional sintering of the starting Mg-transition-metal powder over 800–1000 °C produces porous, multiphase material with segregated transition-metal clusters.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A slight argon overpressure during sintering will suppress Mg vaporization.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The transient liquid will accelerate particle rearrangement and solution-precipitation kinetics.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The transient liquid will dissolve and homogenize the transition-metal solute before solidifying into a fine, continuous matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The transient liquid lowers the activation energy for diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mg volatility becomes significant above 900 °C.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-state diffusion above 900 °C produces coarse, unstable intermetallic precipitates.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A uniform solute distribution will act as a barrier to oxygen diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e",
        "PMC6513993::chunk::000::abstract::e30693f104"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized material will exceed 98% relative density.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized material will have a corrosion current density at least 50% below the baseline.",
